  "bodyHash": "8ph6G9JbJVg=",
  "content": "<p><center><a title=\"https://cobblemon.com\" href=\"https://cobblemon.com\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/aerodactyl_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"660\" /></a></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\">Cobblemon 是一款面向 Fabric 和 NeoForge 的开源宝可梦模组。</font></span></center></p>\n<p><span>Cobblemon 的目标是成为适合所有人的宝可梦模组，并比其他宝可梦模组更好地融入整合包和 Minecraft 本身。我们的源代码开放，不仅鼓励社区贡献，也支持分支开发。</span></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<center><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2tsCcWbiYgA?si=zAfUCC1MLsPih05i\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></center>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>功能特色（截至目前！）：</em></strong></font></span></center></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>捕捉宝可梦来扩展你的队伍，与野生宝可梦对战获得经验，升级解锁新招式，并进化你的宝可梦。有超过 700 种宝可梦可供捕捉！</span></li>\n<li><span>使用 <a title=\"https://pokemonshowdown.com\" href=\"https://pokemonshowdown.com\"><span><em>Pok&eacute;mon Showdown!</em></span></a> 引擎进行对战，实现精准的竞技对战机制。</span></li>\n<li><span>部分<em>传说 阿尔宙斯</em>风格机制，例如招式回忆、物理逃离战斗，以及由<em>你</em>决定何时进化宝可梦。</span></li>\n<li><span>可在对战中切换自由移动。你可以在宝可梦对战期间建造、挖掘或与怪物战斗！</span></li>\n<li><span>用宝可梦图鉴记录你看到和捕捉的宝可梦。它们配有扫描功能，可以分析野生宝可梦！</span></li>\n<li><span>骑乘你的宝可梦，以独特风格探索 Minecraft 世界！</span></li>\n<li><span>在多人游戏中与朋友交易和对战。</span></li>\n<li><span>使用牧场让你的宝可梦在你想要的任何地方自由漫游！</span></li>\n<li><span>树果可以在野外找到，在农田种植，堆肥获得增益，并通过杂交培育出新品种树果。</span></li>\n<li><span>将作物和树果放入酿造台可以制作药物物品。酿造的药剂治疗效果更好！</span></li>\n<li><span>探索世界中的古代结构。其中一些结构有镀金宝箱，可能包含有价值的战利品或其他惊喜！</span></li>\n<li><span>通过在特定地点挖掘可疑的沙砾或沙子可以发现化石，然后可以使用复活机器将其复活。</span></li>\n<li><span>第 1 到第 9 世代的所有宝可梦都可以生成和对战，但如果它们还没有模型，则会显示为替身娃娃。</span></li>\n<li><span>支持多种生物群系模组，包括 <span><a title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/terralith\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/terralith\"><em>Terralith</em></a></span>、<a title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biomesyougo\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biomesyougo\"><span><em>Oh The Biomes You'll Go</em></span></a> 和 <a title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wwoo\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wwoo\"><span><em>William Wythers' Overhauled Overworld</em></span></a>。支持的其他模组列表也在不断增加！</span></li>\n<li><span>通过数据包和资源包完全支持自定义变种和原创宝可梦。你可以使用<a href=\"https://cobblemon.com/guides/custompokemon.html\">我们的指南</a>了解如何操作！<span></li>\n<li><span><a title=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\"><em>Cobbled Farms</em></a>，一个由我们团队构建的教学世界，以互动方式引导你了解模组的功能。它还附带我们的官方整合包！</span></li>\n<li><span>支持 Fabric 和 NeoForge - 但我们建议在 Fabric 上游玩，因为它性能更好！</span></li>\n<li><span><strong><em>... 还有更多功能即将推出！</em></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>安装</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><span><strong><em>Fabric：</em></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>需要适用于你 Minecraft 版本的推荐 <span><a title=\"https://fabricmc.net/\" href=\"https://fabricmc.net/\">Fabric Loader</a></span> 版本。</span></li>\n<li><span>需要 <span><a title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\">Fabric API</a><span>。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span>将 Fabric API 和 Cobblemon-Fabric 放入 mods 文件夹。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><strong><em>NeoForge：</em></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>需要适用于你 Minecraft 版本的推荐 <span><a title=\"https://projects.neoforged.net/neoforged/neoforge\" href=\"https://projects.neoforged.net/neoforged/neoforge\">NeoForge</a></span> 版本。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">需要 <span style=\"color: #333399;\"><a style=\"color: #333399;\" title=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/kotlin-for-forge\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/kotlin-for-forge\">Kotlin for Forge</a><span style=\"color: #000000;\">。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span>将 Kotlin for Forge 和 Cobblemon-NeoForge 放入 mods 文件夹。</span></li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n<p><span>就这样，你准备好了！如果安装遇到问题，请通过下面的链接在我们的 Discord 中寻求帮助。</span></p>\n<p><span>或者，你可以在 <span><a title=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/cobblemon-fabric\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/cobblemon-fabric\">Modrinth</a></span> 或 <span><a title=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblemon-fabric\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblemon-fabric\">CurseForge</a></span> 上下载官方 Cobblemon 整合包！我们建议使用 <span><a title=\"https://modrinth.com/app\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/app\"> Modrinth App</a></span> 下载整合包，但<span><a title=\"https://prismlauncher.org\" href=\"https://prismlauncher.org\"> Prism Launcher</a></span> 也是一个很好的替代启动器，可以从这些网站中的任何一个下载整合包。</span></p>\n<p><strong><em>注意：</em> Cobblemon 没有官方服务器。</strong> 你可以在我们的<a title=\"https://cobblemon.com/en/servers\" href=\"https://cobblemon.com/en/servers\">网站</a>上或我们 Discord 的 #server-listings 频道中找到公共服务器列表，并将它们添加到多人游戏菜单中。或者，你可以从诸如 <a title=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/cobblemon\" href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/cobblemon\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a> 等主机商处购买自己的服务器。</p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/bisect_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2172\" height=\"360\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><strong><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></em></strong></span></center></p>\n<p><span><strong><em>备注：</em></strong> Cobblemon 模组仍在开发中，并正在积极更新。有许多功能正在进行中或是占位符，直到完成。还有一些现有功能将随着我们的推进而得到更多完善。计划中的功能还有很多，包括但不限于 NPC、骑乘宝可梦、繁殖和结构等。<br /></span></p>\n<p><span>加入我们的 Discord 以关注开发进度、与团队聊天、提问并抢先了解即将推出的功能！</span></p>\n<p><center><a title=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/discord_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"224\" height=\"50\" /></a><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>捕捉宝可梦来完善你的宝可梦图鉴！</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/b35c1c743230736b7f1a658681b9e2474551d3de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"951\" height=\"534\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>使用宝可梦图鉴的扫描功能分析宝可梦！</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/3867190664feae606c624ebda171faf5a2289c1b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"951\" height=\"534\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>在由 Pok&eacute;mon Showdown! 驱动的宝可梦对战中战斗！</strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/9da617c7af3e4db862db86f9224cb7ed0a89d061.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>将你的宝可梦放入牧场，让它们在你的世界中漫游！<br /></strong></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/a44d47d5cef64865f82e73f67e92bf127d1d0a67.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>寻找树果，建立树果农场，并杂交培育树果！</strong></font></span>&nbsp;</center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/7e70e7b6c9f7d3fe755a5d56877cdc108da5dd7f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>挖掘化石并将它们复活成古代宝可梦！</strong></font></span>&nbsp;</center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/cf697ecf20efc8aa3c3a5c535ff21b686db39cce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"5\"><strong>探索新结构并勇敢面对秘密试炼以寻找宝藏！</strong></font></span>&nbsp;</center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/images/739bfe6d514e52f34aa342d5bb96fe4c75e2d3d6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\" /></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>许可证：</em></strong><em>&nbsp;</em></span><span><em>模组的二进制文件及其源代码根据 Mozilla Public License 2.0 授权，允许公开修改和分支，前提是它们也根据 MPL2.0 授权。</em></font></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><strong><em>Cobblemon 与宝可梦和 Minecraft 均无关联。</em></font></strong></span></center></p>\n<p><center><span><font size=\"4\"><em>Minecraft 是 Mojang Synergies AB 的商标 ｜ 宝可梦是 Nintendo、Creatures Inc. 和 GAME FREAK inc. 的商标。</em></font></span></center></p>",
